[错误类型] OpenAIAPIError
[错误信息] Error code: 524 - {'error': {'message': 'The origin web server did not return a complete response within the 120-second Proxy Read Timeout window. The connection was established, but the origin took too long to respond. (request id: 202609230339044377558258268d9d6ivhC5mkK)', 'type': 'bad_response_status_code', 'param': '', 'code': 'bad_response_status_code'}}
[原因判断] 中转网关等待上游模型超过 120 秒；不是 PostgreSQL 或 RAG 查询错误。
[建议操作] 保持 gpt-5.5、--max-retries 0，并将 TRADINGAGENTS_RAG_TOP_K 调为 5 以减少上下文。
